# {{ .input_project_name }}

> A production-ready Databricks AI agent project. Deploys a LangGraph RAG agent using Databricks Vector Search, Unity Catalog function tools, MLflow 3 evaluation, and Mosaic AI model serving — with a Dash chat UI as a Databricks App. Managed as a Databricks Asset Bundle (DAB) with dev, staging, and prod environments.

**Stack:** Databricks Asset Bundles · MLflow 3 · LangGraph · Mosaic AI · Unity Catalog · Python 3.10+
**Generated from:** [AgentOps Stacks](https://github.com/databricks/mlops-stacks)

