## Configuration

- [databricks.yml](databricks.yml): Bundle root — set `targets.dev.workspace.host` before first deploy; set `agent_serving_endpoint` after ModelServing completes and redeploy
- [data_preparation/DataIngestion.py](data_preparation/DataIngestion.py): Change `data_source_url` widget default to point at your data source
- [agent_development/app.py](agent_development/app.py): Modify LLM endpoint, UC function tool list, and Vector Search retriever config
- [agent_development/Agent.py](agent_development/Agent.py): Add, remove, or redefine Unity Catalog function tools

## Pipeline Notebooks

Execute these in order. Each notebook is also run automatically by the DAB jobs.

- [data_preparation/DataIngestion.py](data_preparation/DataIngestion.py): **Step 1** — Fetches XML sitemap, scrapes each page with BeautifulSoup, writes raw text rows to `{{ .input_schema_name }}.raw_documentation`
- [data_preparation/DataPreprocessing.py](data_preparation/DataPreprocessing.py): **Step 2** — Reads raw table, splits documents into chunks using HuggingFace tokenizer, writes `{{ .input_schema_name }}.databricks_documentation`
- [data_preparation/VectorSearch.py](data_preparation/VectorSearch.py): **Step 3** — Creates or syncs a Databricks Vector Search index on the preprocessed table using `databricks-gte-large-en` embeddings
- [agent_development/Agent.py](agent_development/Agent.py): **Step 4** — Creates UC SQL functions, writes `ModelConfig.yml`, logs `app.py` as a `ResponsesAgent` with MLflow, registers the model
- [agent_development/AgentEvaluation.py](agent_development/AgentEvaluation.py): **Step 5** — Loads the registered model, runs `mlflow.genai.evaluate()` with LLM-as-a-judge scorers, logs results to the MLflow experiment
- [agent_deployment/ModelServing.py](agent_deployment/ModelServing.py): **Step 6** — Calls `agents.deploy()` to create a Mosaic AI serving endpoint; grants the Databricks App service principal `CAN_QUERY`

## DAB Jobs (CLI run commands)

- [resources/data-preparation-resource.yml](resources/data-preparation-resource.yml): `data_preprocessing_job` — runs Steps 1–3 in sequence; scheduled daily at 5am UTC
- [resources/agent-resource.yml](resources/agent-resource.yml): `agent_development_job` — runs Steps 4–6 in sequence; scheduled daily at 6am UTC

